Attention output 

The attention output \mathbf{u}_{t} can be calculated with the following:
\begin{align}
    \mathbf{o}_{t,i} &amp;= \sum_{j=1}^{t} \operatorname{softmax}_j \left(\frac{\mathbf{q}_{t,i}^{\top}\mathbf{k}_{j,i}}{\sqrt{d_h + d_h^R}}\right) \mathbf{v}_{j,i}^C\quad \quad \tag{10} \\
    \mathbf{u}_t &amp;= \mathbf{W}^O [\mathbf{o}_{t,1}; \mathbf{o}_{t,2}; \dots; \mathbf{o}_{t, n_h}] \quad \tag{11}
\end{align}

